        rdfs:comment                   "Textile fragment of silk damask, France, 1730-1765"@en , "Textile fragment of silk damask woven with a floral design in white on a black ground. This consist of sinuous stems with serrated leaves and carnation-like flowers. Damask woven with a contrasting warp and weft, and the black ground is woven in satin and the white pattern bound in twill."@en ;
